'''Hitmonchan''' (Japanese: '''エビワラー''' ''Ebiwalar'') is a {{ct|Fighting}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Shining Revelry}} expansion.

