==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Team Up|Hitmonchan|74}} from the {{TCG|Team Up}} expansion; both cards have the Magnum Punch attack.
*'''Magnum Punch''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Gym Heroes|Rocket's Hitmonchan|11}} from the {{TCG|Gym Heroes}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

